    "<div style='text-align:Left; font-size:12pt;'><p><span>This polygon feature class outlines African Nova Scotian Communities in the municipality, giving planners geospatial data for strategic planning. It aids mapping and targeted efforts to support inclusive growth and economic prosperity.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>African Nova Scotian communities that correspond to any GSA Community Boundary are identified by the GSA_ID. Currently, this is a subset of the community boundary layer, but this may change as the ANS community boundaries are further refined.</span></p><p><a href='https://hrm.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/4fbfb88d1ac44f589829c1c5de858e74/data' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Metadata</a><span></span></p></div>"
